00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:25.930
And so I thought, like, my take on it was, and I was very happy that everyone in production
所以我当时的想法是——我很庆幸制作组的每个人都同意这一点，

337
00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:29.610
agreed that, but there was a lot of discussion about it.
虽然当时关于这一点有很多讨论。

338
00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:31.710
But this is obviously an amateur production.
但这显然是一场业余制作。

339
00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:34.350
It's a little regional theater production in Scranton, Pennsylvania.
这只是宾夕法尼亚州斯克兰顿的一个小型地区剧院制作。

340
00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:41.790
But there's no reason that people in Scranton, Pennsylvania aren't, like, passionate about
但没理由说斯克兰顿的人们就不会对音乐剧充满热情，

341
00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:46.170
musical theater and extremely talented and coming from all walks of life and just really
或者他们就不是才华横溢、来自各行各业，并且真心渴望做好这件事，

342
00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:49.850
eager to do this and that maybe there's a really great director in the town who did a
也许镇上真的有一位非常出色的导演，

343
00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:51.150
great job casting this thing.
把选角工作做得非常棒。

344
00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:57.370
And then when we made the decision to sort of commit to a really good production, that
当我们决定要投入去做一场真正高质量的制作时，

345
00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:03.110
then also cascaded down into, like, OK, so the costumes are really well done and the sets
这种态度也延伸到了其他方面，比如：好吧，那服装要做得非常精致，布景

346
00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:04.070
are going to look good.
也要看起来很棒。

347
00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:10.370
And, you know, Andy has a big fumble with his cell phone in the production, which is kind
而且，你知道，安迪在演出中手机出了大岔子，这算是，

