00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:19.350
It's not, like, it's not, it's not these, these, like, you know, supporting actors who
这并不是说，并不是这些配角演员们……

351
00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:23.250
are, who came in to, like, you know, really sing and perform for us.
他们是来这里，你知道的，真正为我们演唱和表演的。

352
00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.710
They're not the butt of the joke.
他们不是笑话的对象。

353
00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:25.330
Right, right.
没错，没错。

354
00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:29.530
They're part of the fabric of this, the premise of this episode.
他们是这一集故事结构和前提的一部分。

355
00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:35.110
And I was excited to honor them and honor that and honor, honor regional theater in that
我很兴奋能向他们致敬，向这一点致敬，向地区剧院致敬，以这种

356
00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:35.390
way.
方式。

357
00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:36.650
I love that.
我喜欢这一点。

358
00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.050
Because, I mean, I've been to great regional theater.
因为，我的意思是，我去看过很棒的地区剧院演出。

359
00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:43.630
And we've all, like, supported, like, smaller theaters and came up and doing theater.
我们大家都支持过小型剧院，也是从那里起步并从事戏剧表演的。

360
00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:45.710
And I thought that was a great choice.
我觉得这是一个很棒的选择。

361
00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:46.870
I'm glad you fought for it.
很高兴你为此争取过。

