00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:33.410
You have one of my favorite lines in this episode, Jenna, which was when you guys check in with Ellie on the phone.
珍娜，这一集里你有一句我最喜欢的台词，就是你们在电话里和艾莉确认的时候。

