00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:20.230
And it really, it gave Andy, I think, a sort of authenticity in this episode that he really struggles with in most of the Dunder Mifflin universe.
我认为这确实赋予了安迪一种真实感，而这种真实感他在邓德·米夫林公司的大多数时候都很难展现出来。

410
00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:23.210
Well, I loved the ending of this episode.
嗯，我非常喜欢这一集的结尾。

