00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:41.450
And you have this montage of all this group of people and where they're at in life and dealing with whatever it is they're dealing.
然后你看到了一段蒙太奇，展示了这群人以及他们目前的生活状态，还有他们正在应对的各种事情。

